          "statement": "请求主张覆盖 GET/POST、header/body、变量替换、相对 URL、charset、redirect、Cookie、并发/频率限制和响应解码，并区分静态配置事实、生产可达分支与仍需 Android characterization 的可观察结果。",
          "verified_by": ["android-intake-contract", "harness-tests"],
          "requirement_clauses": [],
          "knowledge_claims": []
        },
        {
