          "verified_by": ["android-intake-contract", "harness-tests"],
          "requirement_clauses": [],
          "knowledge_claims": []
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-4",
          "statement": "流水线主张逐阶段说明输入、输出、上下文传递、URL 归一化和错误/取消边界；不得把源码调用顺序直接冒充跨端 expected，也不得在本项写 SourceLab scenario、Android golden、canonicalizer 或 Swift 实现。",
